Model data
----------

`assets/tiny-voca.gguf` is the upstream `gguf/tiny-voca-js.gguf`
([weights on Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/n4ze3m/tiny-voca)): the
Q8_0-quantized tiny-voca model plus its phonemizer dictionary and tables in
one file. This file is **model data licensed under the Apache License 2.0**
and is *not* covered by the project's MIT license; its terms are stated in
`vendor/LICENSE-tiny-voca`.
